%I A401530 #11 Nov 10 2026 17:49:06
%S A401530 1,1255,4063,5359,6583,11623,14359,14863,15943,4069260,4251156,5042030
%N A401530 Numbers k such that psi(k) = phi(k) + omega(k)^9.
%H A401530 S. I. Dimitrov, <a href="https://github.com/Stoyan16/Numbers-k-such-that-psi-k-phi-k-omega-k-9/blob/main/A401530">Python program</a> (GitHub).
%e A401530 1255 is a term since psi(1255) = 1512 = 1000 + 2^9 = phi(1255) + omega(1255)^9.
%o A401530 (PARI) isok(k) = {my(f = factor(k)); prod(i=1, #f~, (f[i, 1]+1) * f[i, 1]^(f[i, 2]-1)) - eulerphi(f) == omega(f)^9; } \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Oct 28 2026
%Y A401530 Cf. A000010, A001221, A001615, A398806, A399921.
%K A401530 nonn,hard,more,new
%O A401530 1,2
%A A401530 _S. I. Dimitrov_, Oct 28 2026
